\section*{Rate Derivation (With Constants)}
Rearrange [Step 28] to isolate the gradient norm:
\begin{align}
\frac{\eta E}{8} \mathbb{E}[\|\nabla f(w_t)\|^2] \leq f(w_t) - \mathbb{E}[f(w_{t+1})] + 8 E L \eta^2 \sigma^2 + 12 L \eta^2 E^2 \Gamma^2 \quad \text{[Step 29]}
